  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Maximum number of emission lines</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#916;n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#916;n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>&#916;n</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Maximum number of emission&nbsp;lines=<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p>These lines correspond to the lyman series of the hydrogen spectrum</p></blockquote>",
